WEBVTT

00:00:25.951 --> 00:00:27.553
<v><b>J:</b></v> Sarah! Sorry I’m late!

00:00:27.584 --> 00:00:29.172
<v><b>S:</b></v> Same old Jake.

00:00:29.264 --> 00:00:31.397
You always were late for everything.

00:00:33.024 --> 00:00:34.261
Good to see you.

00:00:34.685 --> 00:00:35.395
You look well.

00:00:35.527 --> 00:00:36.760
<v><b>J:</b></v> You look fantastic.

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:38.403
<v><b>S:</b></v> Thank you.

00:00:39.622 --> 00:00:41.650
What would you like? I’m having a flat white.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:44.053
<v><b>J:</b></v> Oh, er…The same for me.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.471
And a croissant or something…

00:01:02.926 --> 00:01:06.699
It’s really great to see you, Sarah, just like old times.

00:01:08.524 --> 00:01:09.462
You haven’t changed.

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.268
And…I miss you…

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:19.288
We need to meet again before I go back to the States.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:21.115
Are you doing anything on Saturday?

00:01:21.549 --> 00:01:23.650
<v><b>S:</b></v> Well, actually I’m…

00:01:23.651 --> 00:01:26.434
<v><b>J:</b></v> Lunch? Dinner? Breakfast?

00:01:26.805 --> 00:01:31.510
<v><b>S:</b></v> Jake, there’s something I need to tell you.

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:42.157
I’m not single now, in fact, um… in fact I’m seeing someone, he’s called Mike,

00:01:42.158 --> 00:01:45.686
and… we’re getting married this Saturday.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.910
That’s why I’m so busy all this week…

00:01:50.055 --> 00:01:54.955
<v><b>J:</b></v> Wow! Um, that’s… That’s great news!

00:01:57.582 --> 00:01:58.641
I wish you all the best!

00:02:00.532 --> 00:02:01.188
<v><b>S:</b></v> Thanks, Jake.

00:02:01.998 --> 00:02:13.903
<v><b>A:</b></v> Jake, it’s you! How’s the conference? You didn’t pick up my messages… Oh! Is this…?